# AI Provider Implementation Patterns

## AIProvider Protocol

All AI providers must conform to the `AIProvider` protocol:

```swift
protocol AIProvider {
    var name: String { get }
    var requiresAPIKey: Bool { get }
    
    func streamResponse(
        config: ModelConfig,
        messages: [LLMMessage],
        tools: [UserTool]?,
        onChunk: @escaping (String) -> Void,
        onToolCall: @escaping (ToolCall) -> Void,
        onComplete: @escaping (String, [ToolCall]?) async -> Void
    ) async throws
    
    func validateAPIKey(_ key: String) async throws -> Bool
    func listModels() async throws -> [Model]
}
```

## Provider Implementation Structure

```swift
